                "entry_id": "b8da4f7a-0c21-32dd-8476-e857af4a79e6",
                "word": "darknet",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e6669e29-ad8f-4a57-b28f-eb05f8f64ae1",
                        "entry_id": "b8da4f7a-0c21-32dd-8476-e857af4a79e6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "darknets"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0e642c4-0ae4-3e59-a402-bbe5aa5fa456",
                        "entry_id": "b8da4f7a-0c21-32dd-8476-e857af4a79e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A network of computers that can only be accessed using special software, configuration, or authorization, usually characterized by the anonymization of users, participating hosts, or both."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ef67b85-f840-493c-bf02-e959885dbf96",
                                "sense_id": "c0e642c4-0ae4-3e59-a402-bbe5aa5fa456",
                                "text": "Despite all the openness of the Internet, there are still places you cannot saunter into on the Web. You must be invited. These are “darknets”: exclusive peer-to-peer networks in which membership is based on circles of trust, whose activities are veiled from the general public."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "736d9ccc-e6c3-434a-9a02-4a5430d5b041",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8da4f7a-0c21-32dd-8476-e857af4a79e6",
                        "source_sense_id": "c0e642c4-0ae4-3e59-a402-bbe5aa5fa456",
                        "source_sense_description": "network",
                        "target_lang_word": "darknet",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "darknet",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c28097f-36fa-3bdb-942d-c56b0200cfe8",
                                        "entry_id": "c1056868-609a-34ce-ab5e-230bde4a6397",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Réseau superposé dont la caractéristique principale est l’anonymat. Pour cette raison, ce type de réseau est beaucoup utilisé pour des activités illégales."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Réseaux informatiques"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed8fc319-8388-4779-bca1-308350148ad7",
                                                "sense_id": "0c28097f-36fa-3bdb-942d-c56b0200cfe8",
                                                "text": "À l’origine de l’affaire, selon une source proche du dossier, un agent spécialisé de la police judiciaire de Lyon avait réalisé une « cyberpatrouille » en s’infiltrant sur le darknet, et était tombé sur le projet du détenu, qui purgeait une peine pour viols sur mineurs commis sur des membres de sa famille, mais pas sur sa fille."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "633c0c2e-b787-4411-a496-9aa98e359f07",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8da4f7a-0c21-32dd-8476-e857af4a79e6",
                        "source_sense_id": "c0e642c4-0ae4-3e59-a402-bbe5aa5fa456",
                        "source_sense_description": "network",
                        "target_lang_word": "Darknet",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Darknet",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05252249-fe72-36ec-8d50-66f45b8845d2",
                                        "entry_id": "7feaf071-a447-3696-aeb4-3531ad60b75c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Peer-to-Peer-Overlay-Netzwerk, dessen Teilnehmer ihre Verbindungen untereinander manuell herstellen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecc23598-2041-4683-95a2-eb9f959556e5",
                                                "sense_id": "05252249-fe72-36ec-8d50-66f45b8845d2",
                                                "text": "\"Die Forscher betrachteten dafür in einer Studie über knapp zwei Jahre die Verkaufszahlen von 35 Plattformen im sogenannten Darknet, auf denen Drogenhandel und andere kriminelle Geschäfte abgewickelt werden.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a00dca28-0605-4da3-9d18-0abb4999d85a",
                                                "sense_id": "05252249-fe72-36ec-8d50-66f45b8845d2",
                                                "text": "„Und wenn Dengelmann das Kartensegment vor uns in die Hände bekam, war ich mir sicher, dass es in kürzester Zeit im Darknet an den Höchstbietenden gehen würde.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c8a3f4f6-6392-432f-8389-4c3ceb4d563f",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8da4f7a-0c21-32dd-8476-e857af4a79e6",
